  is a         cube 0.02 m, 0.02 kg
  at           −0.556059 m along, 0.551004 m up
  slides on    cart1 spring track, along x
  travels      from −0.20 m to 0 m
  spring       18 N/m toward 0 m
  starts slid  −0.20 m
  damping      0.20 N·s/m
  friction     0.68
  bounce       0.05
  colour       black

